# Service role key (server-side only) -- NOT fetchable via the
# Supabase MCP tools (correctly withheld, it's secret-tier). Get it
# from this project's dashboard: Settings -> API -> service_role key,
# and paste it in below. Nothing works server-side (CLI, nucleus-server.ts,
# the queue, telemetry persistence) until this is set.
NUCLEUS_SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=""

# Un-prefixed server-side names, read directly via process.env (not
# import.meta.env) -- same value as the VITE_ ones above.
